SUMMARY:NIH Summer Internship Program (SIP) (Engineering) due
DESCRIPTION:https://www.training.nih.gov/research-training/pb/sip/\nFor Summer 2027: U.S. citizen or permanent resident\, age 18 by September 30\, 2027 (with exceptions for high school seniors turning 18 by Sept 30)\, enrolled at least half-time as HS senior at time of application AND graduated before internship start\, or enrolled in accredited college/university/community college at time of application\, or accepted into accredited graduate program for fall. Student is rising junior (11th grade) in Sept 2026\, so would need to be HS senior at application time (Jan 2027) and graduate before May 10\, 2027 start date — unlikely unless graduating early.
URL:https://www.training.nih.gov/research-training/pb/sip/
END:VEVENT
