DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260930
SUMMARY:Coca-Cola Scholars Foundation (General (not field-specific)) due
DESCRIPTION:https://www.coca-colascholarsfoundation.org/apply/\nHigh school seniors (Class of 2027) graduating during 2026-2027 school year\, attending school in one of 50 U.S. states\, D.C.\, Puerto Rico\, or select DoD schools. Must be U.S. Citizen\, U.S. National\, U.S. Permanent Resident\, Refugee\, Asylee\, Cuban-Haitian Entrant\, or Humanitarian Parolee. Must have minimum 3.0 GPA. Cannot be child/grandchild of Coca-Cola Company employees or retirees receiving benefits.
URL:https://www.coca-colascholarsfoundation.org/apply/
END:VEVENT
